		{
			dependencies: ["7BA4F682A924A1A4"]
			description: [
				"Making use of the Cart Assembler, you can move Budding Certus Quartz anywhere you want! The Flawless Budding Certus Quartz produces the fastest. There is at least one in every meteorite. "
				""
				"Assemble the contraption as shown below, and then pick it up using a wrench. "
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/certus_quartz_contraption.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"Then, place the contraption on a rail in your base, or wherever you'd like to, and then break the minecart beneath it to disassemble the contraption."
			]
