		{
			dependencies: [
				"13461C37F7C27795"
				"48E21FCFF19DA1FB"
				"5BB56D4D044A68FD"
			]
			description: [
				"The ME Controller is the core of any real ME setup."
				""
				"While small networks top out at 8 channels, a controller can boost that limit massively, up to 32 channels per face, or 216 per block! But that's not all. The ME controller can actually be made into a multiblock structure, with a max of 7x7x7 in size and it can be a freeform configuration within this max size. "
				""
				"Additionally, your network can only have one ME controller or multiblock at a time. If you try to add another separate controller structure, the network will crash entirely."
				""
				"The ME Controller also adds an 8kAE buffer to the ME System."
			]
			id: "5A43EC5BF114639D"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 16
					id: "010BAFDAD81F47D5"
					item: "ae2:printed_silicon"
