		{
			dependencies: ["54C539055C823294"]
			description: [
				"The Annihilation Plane can be used to break blocks and collect them in your ME system. It is recommended to use it with a subnet, and they can also be enchanted with silk touch. The items must have somewhere to go, so you'll need something like a storage bus going into a barrel or chest on the subnet."
				""
				"They can also be used to automatically harvest certus quartz crystals and dust from budding certus quartz. Just be sure not to accidentally pickup the budding certus quartz with it, and set the storage bus's filter with either crystals or dust! This way the annihilation plane will not break the crystal until it has fully grown."
			]
			id: "6FACE33CD107ABC8"
			rewards: [
