		{
			dependencies: ["59E5BB32D828DF07"]
			description: [
				"The ME Interface is the bridge between your ME network and the outside world."
				""
				"It acts like a small chest or tank that your network can automatically fill or empty. Stock up to 9 slots at a time, move fluids as well as items, and use it to craft, buffer, or control automation. It’s a key component for connecting machines and systems to your network!"
				""
				"It can also be used with the Induction Card and Stored FE to push power to your machines. You'll have to change the Interface to its cable subpart variant by sticking it back into the crafting menu."
