		{
			dependencies: ["3FBAA2DB5C6F0A2E"]
			description: [
				"The AE Stock Bridge allows your ME system to communicate with Create!"
				"First, right-click an existing stock ticker or stock link with the AE Stock Bridge. Then, place the AE Stock Bridge and connect it to your ME network. Attach a packager facing into the bridge and a frogport on top of the packager. Give the frogport and the AE Stock Bridge the same name (e.g. “AE” as shown in the image below)."
				""
				"Next, set up a second packager and frogport in your network so you can send packages. Make sure a crafting CPU is also connected to your ME system. If you have a stock keeper linked to your network, you’ll even be able to request packages directly from your ME system."
