		{
			dependencies: ["3FBAA2DB5C6F0A2E"]
			description: [
				"The Storage Bus lets your ME network see and use any inventory it’s attached to. Attach it to a chest or other inventory and the network can insert and extract items as if it were part of your storage. Filter the bus to only allow specific items or fluids, and even set up priority so it’s filled before or after other storages."
				""
				"You can also partition the bus to only accept what’s already in the inventory, control insertion and extraction separately, and restrict access to one or both directions. Right-click with a container like a bucket or tank to set its filter to that fluid instead of the container itself."
